        "content": "**AI pipeline** \u2014 `call.concealed_pct` is the bridge: it is the share of audio the *recognizer* heard as filler, and it should track the network loss above. Token counts and time-to-first-token live on the Agent Observability spans, not here, because Datadog derives its own platform metrics from those span attributes.",
        "background_color": "green",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
